OL,3,GNEWSAYouth board to help decide on #20m
OL,4,Aregeneration
OL,5,
OL,6,FYoung people will have a chance to be
OL,7,Finvolved in deciding how to spend #20m
OL,8,Fin their town.
OL,10,FWashington on Wearside is among the
OL,11,Fareas to receive government funding as
OL,12,Fpart of the Pride In Place scheme,
OL,13,Faimed at regenerating towns and
OL,14,Fneighbourhoods over the next 10 years.
OL,16,FSunderland City Council, which is
OL,17,Finvolved in the project, is looking for
OL,18,Forganisations that can establish and
OL,19,Flead a new youth board.
OL,23,APub: 18-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NE Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
